      },
      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I also participate in a fencing group where Contacts are a core part of the gameplay. We can simply check each other’s icons instead of poking someone with a weapon to see whether they bleed.\n\nBy the way, detecting PhysBones or Contacts cannot 100% determine whether interactions are enabled, since these components also have their own settings for whether they can interact with others.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
